    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_01",
      "hash64": "C6B00BA0BF825A19",
      "text": "Es gibt wahrlich keinen Grund, weshalb Ihr um\\nVergebung bitten müsstet.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_02",
      "hash64": "C6B008A0BF825500",
      "text": "Noble Rioba, Eure Unterweisung hat mir den\\nWeg zu überragender Geschicklichkeit geebnet.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_fairyboss_01",
      "hash64": "15A231192EB8F00F",
      "text": "Ja! Wenn du nicht gewesen wärst, hätte ich mein\\nPokémon nicht entwickeln können![VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_honooboss_01",
      "hash64": "33700B5D07EC0C89",
      "text": "Dank dir können wir es jetzt sogar mit den\\nMobbern an der Akademie aufnehmen!\\r\\nDas meinte selbst Big Boss.[VAR 0x0114(001F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_akuboss_03",
      "hash64": "A36B9764C593AE23",
      "text": "Wie du siehst, sind wir dir echt megadankbar!\\nDu bist ein Vorbild für uns alle im Team, Rioba.[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_03",
      "hash64": "8A4BA52B264665FA",
      "text": "Aaach, ihr übertreibt doch maßlos... Hehe.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_fairyboss_02",
      "hash64": "15A232192EB8F1C2",
      "text": "Allerdings trainieren wir schon seit vier Stunden,\\nund so langsam bin ich am Ende meiner Kräfte...[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_04",
      "hash64": "8A4BA02B26465D7B",
      "text": "Oh, sorry! Natürlich, legt alle eine Pause ein.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_05",
      "hash64": "8A4B9F2B26465BC8",
      "text": "Ich geh in der Zwischenzeit ’ne Runde joggen.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_dokuboss_03",
      "hash64": "C6B009A0BF8256B3",
      "text": "Aber... Während wir anderen abwechselnd\\ntrainierten und somit kurze Pausen genießen\\r\\nkonnten, habt Ihr uns unentwegt unterrichtet...\\c\\nIch komme nicht umhin, mich um Eure körperliche\\nVerfassung zu sorgen.[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 134,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 207,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_06",
      "hash64": "8A4BA22B264660E1",
      "text": "Wie lieb, dass du dich um mich sorgst, Shugi.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_07",
      "hash64": "8A4BA12B26465F2E",
      "text": "Aber in letzter Zeit ist es mir egal, wie müde ich\\nbin oder wie sehr ich am liebsten weinen würde.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_08",
      "hash64": "8A4B9C2B264656AF",
      "text": "Wir haben uns von den Arenaorden inspirieren\\nlassen und unsere ganz eigenen Teamorden\\r\\nkreiert, nicht wahr?[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_21",
      "hash64": "8A45172B26410902",
      "text": "Wenn ich mir die ansehe, fühle ich mich... stark.\\nSie motivieren mich, stets mein Bestes zu geben.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 98,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_09",
      "hash64": "8A4B9B2B264654FC",
      "text": "Ich habe mein Bestes gegeben, aber...\\nEs hat nicht gereicht...[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_kakutouboss_10",
      "hash64": "8A481E2B26434ABE",
      "text": "Du warst wirklich stark. Ich übergebe dir das hier\\nnicht nur, weil unser Kodex es so vorschreibt,\\r\\nsondern auch, weil du es dir verdient hast.[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
