    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_03",
      "hash64": "E7EEF1AC2C216F2B",
      "text": "Worüber wolltest du sprechen?[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_08",
      "hash64": "5C185D40FEE607D5",
      "text": "Ich habe den Eindruck, dass du mit deinem\\nBoss anders umgehst als die anderen Rüpel.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_09",
      "hash64": "5C185C40FEE60622",
      "text": "Wie kommt’s?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_04",
      "hash64": "E7EEF6AC2C2177AA",
      "text": "Dir entgeht wohl gar nichts, was?\\nNa gut, ich erkläre es euch.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_05",
      "hash64": "E7EEF7AC2C21795D",
      "text": "Früher konnte ich Rioba nicht ausstehen...[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 42,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_10",
      "hash64": "5C14DF40FEE2FBE4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_06",
      "hash64": "E7EEF4AC2C217444",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_07",
      "hash64": "E7EEF5AC2C2175F7",
      "text": "Seht sie euch nur an: Sie ist eine klasse Trainerin,\\nabsolute Sportskanone und hübsch noch dazu![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 96,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_08",
      "hash64": "E7EEEAAC2C216346",
      "text": "Kein Wunder, dass Rioba seit ihrem ersten Tag\\nan der Akademie so beliebt war.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 77,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_09",
      "hash64": "E7EEEBAC2C2164F9",
      "text": "Ich hingegen, die vor ihr als beliebteste Schülerin\\ngalt, stand plötzlich in ihrem Schatten.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_11",
      "hash64": "5C14E040FEE2FD97",
      "text": "Deshalb warst du dann gemein zu ihr?[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_10",
      "hash64": "E7F278AC2C248A67",
      "text": "Ja. Ich brachte auch unsere Klassenkameraden\\ndazu, auf ihr rumzuhacken...\\c\\nWir waren richtige Idioten.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 104,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_11",
      "hash64": "E7F277AC2C2488B4",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_12",
      "hash64": "5C14E140FEE2FF4A",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_12",
      "hash64": "E7F27AAC2C248DCD",
      "text": "Doch so wie Kinder schnell das Interesse an\\neinem neuen Spielzeug verlieren, so wechseln\\r\\nMobber ihr Ziel, wenn die Langeweile einsetzt.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 88,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_13",
      "hash64": "E7F279AC2C248C1A",
      "text": "Das nächste Mobbingopfer war dann ich...[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_13",
      "hash64": "5C14E240FEE300FD",
      "text": "[EMPTY 68]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "BDFF",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_14",
      "hash64": "E7F274AC2C24839B",
      "text": "Ich hatte es wohl verdient. Aber Rioba... Sie half\\nmir, obwohl ich vorher so fies zu ihr gewesen war.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_15",
      "hash64": "E7F273AC2C2481E8",
      "text": "Sie wusste, wie schwer es ist, nirgendwo\\ndazuzugehören, und lud mich zu Team Star ein.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_14",
      "hash64": "5C14DB40FEE2F518",
      "text": "Obwohl du sie gemobbt hattest...?\\nWas für ein herzensgutes Mädchen.[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_16",
      "hash64": "E7F276AC2C248701",
      "text": "Ja, das ist sie. Und seit ich dem Team beigetreten\\nbin, habe ich richtig viel Spaß![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_15",
      "hash64": "5C14DC40FEE2F6CB",
      "text": "Manchen Gerüchten zufolge soll ja Team Star\\nandere mobben...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_17",
      "hash64": "E7F275AC2C24854E",
      "text": "Aber glaubst du das wirklich, nachdem du meine\\nGeschichte gehört hast?[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_nelke_16",
      "hash64": "5C14DD40FEE2F87E",
      "text": "Nun, also...[VAR 0x0114(001E)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "001E"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_18",
      "hash64": "E7F270AC2C247CCF",
      "text": "Rioba und Team Star haben mir geholfen, zu der\\nPerson zu werden, die ich heute bin.[VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "ajito_kakutou_040_sitappa_19",
      "hash64": "E7F26FAC2C247B1C",
      "text": "Bitte nehmt uns unseren kostbarsten Schatz\\nnicht weg...![VAR 0x0114(003F)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 56,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "003F"
          ]
        }
      ]
